    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i feel like i've tried talking to people and it never changes anything. it's just... i'm so tired of fighting to stay afloat. do you ever think about how much easier it would be if people could just opt out when things get too heavy? like, is it really so wrong to just want the noise to stop?",
